                        "entry_id": "ad947ce1-2385-3629-b67d-fcf65f53542b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The art of speaking, especially public speaking, with expert control of gesture and voice, diction (articulation and word choice), and usage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
